From: PostgreSQL HTAP lab <noreply@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] executor: add an optional slot-batch transport API

Adds ExecProcNodeBatch() alongside the existing tuple-at-a-time entry point.
The fallback fills a caller-owned array of TupleTableSlots by repeatedly
calling ExecProcNode(); providers may install a batch callback in BatchState.

This patch is required by the xp_batch experimental extension.

